          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.2+EXO.25.3+EXO.25.4+EXO.25.5+EXO.25.6+EXO.25.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 25:2-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngo Mukoranye amashikanwa yo kumushikanira, mukūye ku vyanyu: umuntu wese yumva bivuye ku mutima, abe ari we azana ishikanwa ryo gushikanira Uhoraho; ayo mashikanwa n’aya: amazahabu n’ amafeza n’imiringa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n’inyuzi z’ amasufe n’iz’ amashigisha n’izisa n’agahama n’izera derere, n’ubushenza bg’impene; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n’insāto z’ impfizi z’intama zazizwe mu gahama, n’insāto z’ibikōko vyitwa tahashi, n’imbaho z’ibiti vyitwa imishita; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n’amavuta y’amatara, n’ibintu bimoga vyo kuvanga n’ amavuta yo kurobanuza abahabga ibango, n’ibindi vyo kwosa bitāmirana; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n’utubuyenge twitwa shohamu, n’utundi tubuyenge two gutēra ku mwambaro witwa efodi no ku mwambaro wo mu gikiriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
