        },
        {
          "text": "n’igicaniro co kwoserezakw imibavu, n’iminiho yaco; n’amavuta yo kurobanuza abahabga ibango, n’imibavu itāmirana; n’igihuzu co gukinga mu rwinjiriro rw’umuryango w’iryo hema: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
