          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.31.1+EXO.31.2+EXO.31.3+EXO.31.4+EXO.31.5+EXO.31.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 31:1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose abarira Abisirayeli, at’ Ehe rāba, Uhoraho yahamagaye mw izina Besaleli mwene Uri, Uri mwene Huri, wo mu muryango wa Yuda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi yamwujuje impwemu y’Imana, kugira ngw agire ubgenge no gutahura no kumenya n’ubuhinga bg’uburyo bgose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mu vyo kwigenera ibikorwa vy’ubuhanga, no mu vyo gucura izahabu n’ifeza n’imiringa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no mu vyo gukeba utubuyenge two kurumikwa mw izahabu, no mu bubāji, no mu vy’ ubuhinga bg’uburyo bgose bg’ ubgenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi yashize mu mutima wiwe kwigisha abandi, bo na Oholiyabu mwene Ahisamaki, wo mu muryango wa Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo yabujuje ubgenge mu mitima yabo, bgo gukora ibikorwa vy’ ubuhinga vy’uburyo bgose, bg’ umuntu azi guca amagarwe ku tubuyenge n’ubg’ ubuhinga bgo kujisha, n’ubg’ ubuhinga bgo kujererenga amabara y’inyuzi z’ amasufe n’iz’ amashigisha n’izisa n’agahama n’izera derere, n’ubgo kujisha impuzu, mbere n’ubg’ abakora ibikorwa vyose vy’ubuhinga, n’ubg’ abigenera ibikorwa vy’ubuhanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
